        {
            "number": 7,
            "revision": "9fd501a36b8103a00e6697229890aa619bc26338",
            "parents": [
                "35ae0bb540c16b098b441394c1f7286a85e6e164"
            ],
            "ref": "refs/changes/47/82447/7",
            "uploader": {
                "name": "Eric Yang",
                "email": "eric.yang.wiwynn@gmail.com",
                "username": "fornchu110"
            },
            "createdOn": 1761813996,
            "author": {
                "name": "Eric Yang",
                "email": "eric.yang.wiwynn@gmail.com",
                "username": "fornchu110"
            },
            "kind": "REWORK",
            "comments": [
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Eric Yang",
                        "email": "eric.yang.wiwynn@gmail.com",
                        "username": "fornchu110"
                    },
                    "message": "I\u2019ve changed the implementation of the fail reason from string to enum. As a result, the output has changed from:\n```\nroot@bmc:~# busctl get-property xyz.openbmc_project.State.FanCtrl \\\n/xyz/openbmc_project/settings/fanctrl/zone0 \\\nxyz.openbmc_project.Debug.Pid.Zone FailSafeSensors\na{ss} 18 \"SENTINEL_DOME_SLOT_5_DIMM_A0_TEMP_C\" \"Sensor reading bad\" \\\n\"SENTINEL_DOME_SLOT_5_DIMM_A10_TEMP_C\" \"Sensor reading bad\"\n...\n```\nto something like:\n```\nroot@bmc:~# busctl get-property xyz.openbmc_project.State.FanCtrl \\\n/xyz/openbmc_project/settings/fanctrl/zone0 \\\nxyz.openbmc_project.Debug.Pid.Zone FailSafeSensors\na{ss} 95 \"MEDUSA_MB8_HSC_12V_TEMP_C\" \\\n\"xyz.openbmc_project.Debug.Pid.Zone.FailureReason.MissingSensor\" \\\n...\n\"SENTINEL_DOME_SLOT_7_MB_X8_RTM_TEMP_C\" \\\n\"xyz.openbmc_project.Debug.Pid.Zone.FailureReason.BadReading\"\n...\n```"
                },
                {
                    "file": "pid/zone.hpp",
                    "line": 139,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Josh Lehan",
                        "email": "krellan@gmail.com",
                        "username": "Krellan"
                    },
                    "message": "This seems kind of backwards to me. The failure reasons should be stored and processed internally as enums, not strings. Only when it's time to render them into human-readable form, such as when the D-Bus properties are queried, should they be converted to strings then."
                },
                {
                    "file": "pid/zone.hpp",
                    "line": 139,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Eric Yang",
                        "email": "eric.yang.wiwynn@gmail.com",
                        "username": "fornchu110"
                    },
                    "message": "So, my understanding is that the next step should be to keep the current changes in [82445], and then add a commit in `phosphor-pid-control` to update all fail sensor reasons to use the defined `FailureReason` enum instead of strings. After that, I would adjust this patch accordingly to align with the new approach.\n\nIf I\u2019ve misunderstood, please let me know. Thank you!\n\n\n[82445]: https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/phosphor-dbus-interfaces/+/82445"
                },
                {
                    "file": "pid/zone.hpp",
                    "line": 139,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Eric Yang",
                        "email": "eric.yang.wiwynn@gmail.com",
                        "username": "fornchu110"
                    },
                    "message": "In [85920], I first switched the internal fail reason handling to rely on the `FailureReason` enum defined in `phosphor-dbus-interfaces` in [82455], and in this patch I removed `toEnumReason`.\nIf there\u2019s anything else that needs to be corrected, please let me know.\n\n[85920]: https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/phosphor-pid-control/+/85920\n[82455]: https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/phosphor-dbus-interfaces/+/82445"
                }
            ],
